Design note on the readout: it observes aria-valuetext on the real slider via
MutationObserver rather than deriving the string independently. A second
implementation of the same text would be free to drift from what the widget
actually exposes, which would make the demo actively misleading - the failure
mode the heel-numbering defect in Phase 1 already demonstrated once.

